  "description": "Introducing the UrbanCross - Ultra Electric Assist Bicycle\nExplore the city in style with the UrbanCross -Ultra Electric Assist Bicycle. Available in Sand Yellow/Lava Red, this sleek and dynamic bike offers a perfect blend of performance and aesthetics.\nKey Features:\n·\nSize Options: Choose 3 Size: S M and L sizes for a personalized and comfortable riding experience.\n·\n·\nRear Hub Motor with Torque Sensor: A powerful 250W brushless hub motor, integrated with a 40Nm torque sensor, amplifies pedaling efforts and supports a smoother riding experience.\n·\n·\nShimano 11-speed Derailleur: Equipped with a 11-speed Shimano gearbox, this bike offers the right gear setup for any situation, whether it's climbing a hill or navigating flat terrain.\n·\n·\nSafe and Durable Battery:Featuring UL certified 350Wh batteries, providing support for a long range of 75 miles. Each battery ingerates a Vanpowers BMS (Battery Management System) to optimize heat control, ensuring optimal performance and safty.\n·\n·\nSmooth Ride on Air: The air front fork with 130mm travel offers tremendous versatility for traversing bushes, hills, and gravel. Its super-long travel ensures every ride is as smooth as if you were on paved roads.\n·\n·\nExtended Range: Experience freedom with a range of 55 miles on a single charge, perfect for long-distance rides.\n·\n·\n·\nElevate your commuting experience with the UrbanCross- Ultra. Whether you're navigating city streets or exploring scenic routes, this electric assist bicycle combines style, performance, and safety for an unparalleled riding experience.",
